    is_headword: 1
    pronunciation: /kwɜrk/
    ipa: /kwɜrk/
    definition: A small peculiarity of behavior or style, the kind of idiosyncrasy that makes a person recognizable.
      It can also mean a sudden wry twist, or, in carpentry, a narrow groove cut into a molding.
